It looks like you've already built a solid foundation with a modern, dark-themed stack. To take this portfolio from "functional" to "amazing," we should focus on depth, fluid motion, and narrative flow.

Since you are using Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and Framer Motion, you have the perfect toolkit to implement these changes. Here is a breakdown of how to revamp the color scheme and merge the content with high-end visual effects.

🎨 1. High-Impact Color Scheme
Moving away from a standard dark mode to a "Deep Glassmorphism" or "Midnight Aurora" theme will add instant sophistication.

Element	Suggested Hex / Style	Effect
Primary Background	#050505 to #0a0a1a	A deep navy-black gradient provides more depth than pure black.
