🎨 1. The Global Refinement (Foundations)
Before changing sections, apply these global styles to support both modes:

Dark Mode: Use a "Midnight Navy" (#020617) instead of pure black. Use a high-end Mesh Gradient (blurred circles of Indigo and Violet) that moves slowly in the background.

Light Mode: Use a "Soft Alabaster" (#f8fafc). Instead of colored blobs, use a subtle Dot Matrix grid pattern to keep the "tech" feel.

Typography: Switch to a variable font like Geist or Inter. Use tracking-tight for headings to give them a premium, dense look.

